OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,FEngineering giant JCB has set a new
OL,8,Fworld land speed record after its
OL,9,Fhydrogen-powered car reached an
OL,10,Faverage speed of 406.320mph in the US.
OL,12,FThe Hydromax reached 412.135mph on its
OL,13,Fsecond run across Utah's Bonneville
OL,14,FSalt Flats, after recording 400.623mph
OL,15,Fon its first.
OL,17,FThat gave the car an average speed of
OL,18,F406.320mph - making it the fastest
OL,19,Fhydrogen-powered internal combustion
OL,20,Fcar ever recorded.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
