FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,FThe record-breaking vehicle was
OL,8,Fpowered by two production-based
OL,9,Fhydrogen engines made by JCB, with the
OL,10,Fcompany saying the technology is
OL,11,Falready being used in its diggers.
OL,13,FJCB, which is based in Staffordshire,
OL,14,Fsaid the engines were manufactured at
OL,15,Fits factory in Foston, Derbyshire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,FThe car was driven by Wing Commander
OL,8,FAndy Green OBE, who completed the two
OL,9,Fruns required under Federation
OL,10,FInternationale de l'Automobile (FIA)
OL,11,Frules - one in each direction within
OL,12,Fan hour - beating the previous
OL,13,Fbenchmark of 185.5 mph set by the BMW
OL,14,FH2R in 2004.
OL,26,@qD@VrrqD@Xrr
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
