OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,FThis record - set in the Category A,
OL,8,FGroup XIV - Class 7 FIA World Flying
OL,9,FRecord Start Land Speed Record - was
OL,10,Fset using two of JCB's own production-
OL,11,Fbased hydrogen digger engines,
OL,12,Fproducing a combined 1,600 bhp and
OL,13,Fmanufactured at the company's engine
OL,14,Ffactory in Foston, in Derbyshire.
OL,16,FJCB Chairman Anthony Bamford said:
OL,17,F"Twenty years ago we came to
OL,18,FBonneville with JCB Dieselmax and
OL,19,Fshowed what British engineering could
OL,20,Fdo with diesel power.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,F"Today we have done it again - this
OL,8,Ftime with engines powered by hydrogen.
OL,10,F"This record was set by production-
OL,11,Fbased engines, the same engines
OL,12,Fpowering JCB diggers right now. That
OL,13,Fis the point of JCB Hydromax: it shows
OL,14,Fhydrogen works, and it works today at
OL,15,Fthe highest level with zero emissions."
OL,26,@wD@gO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
