OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786709907
OL,3,CDriver sets new speed record in JCB
OL,4,Chydrogen-powered car at more than
OL,5,C406mph
OL,7,FJCB Engineering Director Ryan Ballard,
OL,8,Fwho is leading the project, said:
OL,9,F"This record belongs to the
OL,10,Fengineering team which took a hydrogen
OL,11,Fdigger engine and made it the fastest
OL,12,Fof its kind on earth.
OL,14,F"This has been an amazing challenge
OL,15,Ffrom the outset of the it being set in
OL,16,FFebruary last year. We came here fully
OL,17,Fprepared, and the car delivered."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/6
